/**
 * BaseballHelm bug-audit findings (2026-06-30).
 *
 * Generated by 8 parallel codebase audits (recruiting/discovery, stats/performance,
 * team operations, communication/content, player daily experience, coach
 * variants/settings/onboarding, CoachHelm AI, mobile UI/UX). Every finding below
 * was verified against on-disk source with file/line evidence and cross-checked
 * against the ~50 open BaseballHelm issues at audit time (#367-#418) to avoid
 * duplicating already-tracked architectural work (active-context migration, RLS
 * scoping, demo seeding, route registry consolidation, product-truth contracts).
 *
 * Run `node scripts/baseballhelm-bug-audit/create-issues.mjs --dry-run` to preview,
 * or without --dry-run (and with --yes) to actually file these via `gh issue create`.
 */

